#: ../../source/users/folio/type/control_diagram.rst:5
msgid "Control diagram"
msgstr "控制图"

#: ../../source/users/folio/type/control_diagram.rst:7
msgid ""
"A control diagram is a representation of the logic from a system, it is a "
"model of the process to automate considering inputs, actions to be carried "
"out and the intermediate processes that cause these actions."
msgstr "一个控制图是一个系统对逻辑的表示，它是进程的一个模型，可以自动考虑投入，将要采取的行动以及导致这些行动的中间进程。"

#: ../../source/users/folio/type/control_diagram.rst:9
msgid "`Single line conductors`_ are used to draw control diagrams."
msgstr "`单行导 <Single line conductors_>`_ 用于绘制控制图。"

#: ../../source/users/folio/type/control_diagram.rst:13
msgid ""
"QElectroTech can represent processes using `IEC 61131-3`_ standards (Ex.: "
"GRAFCET, Ladder, etc.)."
msgstr ""
"QElectroTech可以代表使用 `IEC 61131-3 <IEC 61131-3_>`_ 标准(ex:GRAFCET,Ladder等)的工艺。"

#: ../../source/users/folio/type/control_diagram.rst:18
msgid "Figure: Single line diagram"
msgstr "图：单行图"
